            "created_at": "2025-09-04T07:26:47.530193+00:00",
            "notes": "First round is going to feel like a classic [Weapon Power](stat_weapon_power) [Attack Speed](stat_attack_speed) Mercy build. \n\nYou pick [Threads of Fate](item_cb61612b-9d83-49a9-989d-013bf084fbcb) for your starting power because even with recent nerfs, it's free extra uptime and money generation for your first round. \n\nPick [Compensator](item_2a354f80-610c-4661-9bdd-8960ae1a60b0) and [Weapon Grease](item_961ae72f-434f-406b-a89b-ab8efec806bf) - then take a look at the enemy composition. If they have something like [Reaper](hero_0449752f-1c58-487b-b9a0-ca727d784457) or [Genji](hero_31fd201d-2f46-41e4-b125-9fa9e55fed46) choose [First Aid Kit](item_0172eaaa-1902-44a3-b989-d12f0f7301da) and focus on using your movement and cover to survive.\n\nIf they have long-range threats like [Cassidy](hero_3dd63854-7558-4344-86e4-b506f807129b), [Ashe](hero_37b42a2d-a82d-4a22-9df2-4c812c873b54) or [Soldier: 76](hero_e1ac7ef5-4648-4998-b8b0-9e3da3e60546) and **especially** [Pharah](hero_0baf7420-ff13-4b92-81f7-ca21b61dacf9), I wholly reccommend [Ballistic Buffer](item_40146dd3-a8cb-40ca-8917-c430bfa2be0e) as it will help against getting rolled down with long-range poke.\n\nPlay your life, play safe and don't be embarrassed to healbot for money, it will help later.",
