            "notes": "Just keep on glockin. You got this girlie.\n\nAgain, keep focusing on the 2:1 ratio of [Weapon Power](stat_weapon_power) to [Attack Speed](stat_attack_speed) as much as you can, and look for opportunities to get free money via damage. If you're getting your Valkyrie quick, you're doing it right! Just try to stay with your team because you are still very squishy outside of ultimate.",
