            "notes": "Okay so R5 is where it gets SPICY. \n\nImmediately, you are going to want to pick up [Battle Medic](item_ccd0edff-4d57-4ac2-83a7-bab6ff0ffb2f). This perk has insane synergy with [Tethered Tourniquet](item_9ac02f9a-7c06-46a3-94d4-2ba9a9cf623f) because the seconds of beaming = more damage when you whip out the pistol.\n\nAt this point from mid-range you shouldn't be feeling brave enough to wide-peek enemies as they will also be doing a lot of damage, but don't be afraid to just pistol as long as you have stacks charged.\n\nAt this point I do like to go for [Amari's Antidote](item_67e0b1c5-3bcb-4ab5-b818-5082e5706124) for the extra throughput healing in a pinch, and generally still find [Ironclad Exhaust Ports](item_2d085fa5-ace6-4fab-9323-b7a06268bcd0) useful if I am being focused (only if I am dying first in fights, otherwise not really useful.)",
